data-lake-id=\"ud810ca17\" id=\"ud810ca17\">LSTM/GRU：依赖循环结构逐步传递信息，长距离依赖易受梯度消失/爆炸影响。 </span></li><li fid=\"u0075130d\" data-lake-id=\"ud7aea6d1\" id=\"ud7aea6d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a0ddcd1\" id=\"u8a0ddcd1\">Transformer：通过自注意力机制直接计算任意位置关联，无路径衰减问题。 </span></li></ul><ol list=\"u476bc980\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u7a47d17b\" data-lake-id=\"u622b709d\" id=\"u622b709d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u329454ac\" id=\"u329454ac\">训练效率</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ufbfbe5eb\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ubfd0cebb\" data-lake-id=\"u534459ef\" id=\"u534459ef\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0ca9c19\" id=\"ua0ca9c19\">LSTM/GRU：序列计算无法并行，训练慢。 </span></li><li fid=\"ubfd0cebb\" data-lake-id=\"udd2a7574\" id=\"udd2a7574\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ef79247\" id=\"u6ef79247\">Transformer：全局注意力并行计算，训练速度显著提升。 </span></li></ul><ol list=\"u476bc980\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u7a47d17b\" data-lake-id=\"u5ebc9413\" id=\"u5ebc9413\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ae2b818\" id=\"u5ae2b818\">项目案例验证</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"uab5522b1\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u2b692bca\" data-lake-id=\"u821f7357\" id=\"u821f7357\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc145af78\" id=\"uc145af78\">选择机器翻译（长序列）和文档摘要（超长文本）两个场景对比模型表现。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JxQva%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u250b3237\" id=\"u250b3237\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u7ec3e4d5\" id=\"u7ec3e4d5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751689915032-7ed70ca3-e793-4d88-aacf-39788e251c33.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua6fa45e0-613a-43a1-82f8-4e847b4775e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u125982dc-5cf0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A558.9333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A444%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A182046%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1048%2C%22or